{"id":"ab58cff0cf27c0b4","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded.md","title":"ZFC Ultrapower Wellfounded","display":"df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded — ZFC Ultrapower Wellfounded","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded"],"display":"df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded — ZFC Ultrapower Wellfounded","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrapower]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-wellfounded]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded — ZFC Ultrapower Wellfounded"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"58-df-ultrapower\">58-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,I,U,Q,E_U,P,R,c,f,g\\in V\">\\(M,I,U,Q,E_U,P,R,c,f,g\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> are exact source predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S\\)</span> is the equivalence-class predicate defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\leftrightarrow f\\in P\\land c=\\{g\\in P:\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\leftrightarrow f\\in P\\land c=\\{g\\in P:\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}wellfounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S(Q,E_U,M,U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\exists P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nP=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in P^2:\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q=\\{c\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists f\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land E_U=\\Bigl\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in Q^2:\\exists f,g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(d,g,P,R)\n\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(E_U,Q)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}wellfounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S(Q,E_U,M,U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\exists P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nP=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in P^2:\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q=\\{c\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists f\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land E_U=\\Bigl\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in Q^2:\\exists f,g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(d,g,P,R)\n\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(E_U,Q)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The function carrier, equality-modulo-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> relation, equivalence classes, quotient set, and induced membership relation are all bounded set constructions.  No quotient or class notation is left as an unbound term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellfounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,I,U,Q,E_U,P,R,c,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\leftrightarrow f\\in P\\land c=\\{g\\in P:\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}wellfounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerWellfounded}_S(Q,E_U,M,U,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\exists P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nP=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times M):\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,M)\\}\\\\\n&\\land R=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in P^2:\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,P)\\\\\n&\\land Q=\\{c\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists f\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\}\\\\\n&\\land E_U=\\Bigl\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in Q^2:\\exists f,g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(c,f,P,R)\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{UltrapowerClass}_S(d,g,P,R)\n\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(E_U,Q)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1893,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3853","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded.md|58-df-zfc-ultrapower-wellfounded]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["80d22bbd3f726e33","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","7308daa58e0345ed","36d7463d215be751","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}